; Equal-coordinate final-phase reasons are retained as a bucket. The pending
; entry-shape ruling must total entry/body composition before this can select
; one public rejection. D36 owns
; the earlier receiver grammar and callable-name census; D37 deduplicates one
; body reason/coordinate and makes distinct same-coordinate reasons an internal
; contradiction.
(data DeltaFinalCandidate
  (NoDeltaFinalCandidate)
  (DeltaFinalCandidateAt Int DeltaFinalReasonList))

